sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin / Lecturer
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as Backend API
  participant Store as Supabase Storage
  participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
  participant LLM as Embedding API (DeepSeek / Gemini)

  A->>UI: Enter course info + select file (PDF or PPTX)
  A->>UI: Click Save/Upload
  activate UI
  UI->>API: POST /api/materials/upload (multipart)
  activate API
  API->>API: Validate file type (PDF or PPTX)

  alt invalid file type
    API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
    UI-->>A: Show validation error
  else valid
    API->>Store: Upload file to bucket course-materials
    activate Store
    Store-->>API: storage_path
    deactivate Store

    API->>DB: INSERT materials (status='Processing', course_code, material_type, chapter, storage_path, mime_type, file_size)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: material id
    deactivate DB

    API->>API: Extract text (pdf-parse for PDF, jszip+xml for PPTX)
    API->>API: Chunk text (langchain/textsplitters)
    API->>LLM: Generate embeddings (1536-dim)
    activate LLM
    LLM-->>API: vectors
    deactivate LLM
    API->>DB: INSERT material_chunks (chunk_text, embedding vector(1536), course_code, source_file, chapter)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: chunk ids
    deactivate DB
    API->>DB: UPDATE materials SET status='Active', chunk_count=N
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: ok
    deactivate DB

    API-->>UI: 201 Created (material id)
    UI-->>A: Display success confirmation
  end

  deactivate API
  deactivate UI
